{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Cursed are you from the earth, which opened its mouth.</b> It is cursed from the earth, in that it will not give its strength to him of itself. And second, that even when he labors upon the earth to plow and to sow, it will not give its strength to him as at first; and this is what it says."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:10:14.905184931Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}